    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n12592" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀποθαρρέω</span></b>  and <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπο-θαρσέω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>take
				courage, have full confidence,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Oec.</u>
				16.6
			</span></i>: c. inf., <i>to have the boldness to . .,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Longin.
				32.8
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				J.
				<u>AJ</u>
				15.7.3
			</span></i>: c. acc., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. τὸ πρόσω τῆς πορείας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Paus.
					10.19.5
				</span></i>
			: c. dat., <i>use rashly,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Aët.
				12.23
			</span></i>.</div>
